wn web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'每个语言都拥有各自的网址和站点地图。请仅发布您希望被索引的语言。','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'在发布或更新时自动翻译','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'编辑页面会将其翻译标记为已过期，并在后台重新生成。不更改任何文字的编辑不会产生任何费用。','What gets translated'=>'翻译内容','Post types'=>'文章类型','Translate the web addresses too'=>'同时翻译网址','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'法国访客将访问 /fr/a-propos/ 而不是 /fr/about/。未翻译的地址仍可正常访问并会自动重定向，因此已编入索引的内容均不会失效。','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'翻译 SEO 标题、描述和图像替代文本','Translate categories and tags'=>'翻译分类和标签','Translate navigation menus'=>'翻译导航菜单','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'翻译 WooCommerce 产品和属性','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'简短描述、购买须知、属性标签和变体描述。价格、SKU 及保存的选项值绝不会被修改。','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'添加 hreflang 标签','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'告知搜索引擎这些页面是同一页面的不同语言版本。除非已有其他插件在执行此操作，否则请保持开启。','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'为每种语言发布站点地图','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'为每种语言发布 llms.txt','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'由人工智能回答引擎读取的纯文本站点地图。它们通常无法运行 JavaScript，并且可能永远不会获取站点地图。','Language switcher'=>'语言切换器','Style'=>'样式','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'颜色、间距和圆角位于“样式”标签页中。您可以使用区块、[zinn_language_switcher] 简码或菜单进行放置。','Show only these languages'=>'仅显示这些语言','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'留空可显示您发布的每种语言。','Name each language in its own language'=>'用每种语言自身的语言为其命名','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'是 Deutsch 而不是 German。无法阅读当前页面的人也无法阅读“German”。','Show flags'=>'显示旗帜','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'默认关闭：语言并不代表国家，阿拉伯语和西班牙语也没有任何一面单独的旗帜能够不排除其大部分使用者。','Include the language being read'=>'包含正在阅读的语言','Include the original language'=>'包含原始语言','Add it to this menu'=>'将其添加到此菜单','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'仅限您在此命名的菜单。不会向网站上的任何其他菜单添加任何内容。','Accent'=>'强调','Background'=>'背景','Text'=>'文本','Corner radius'=>'圆角半径','Spacing'=>'间距','Text size'=>'文本大小','Do not add it to a menu'=>'不要将其添加到菜单中','none'=>'无','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard, under "Shown to visitors". This site checks it every hour. Publishing now: %s.'=>'在 Zinn Digital® 方案中，您可以在控制板中此网站的“翻译”标签页下的“向访客显示”中选择要发布的语言。本网站每小时检查一次。正在发布：%s。','On a Zinn Digital® plan you choose the languages to publish on this site\'s Translation tab in your dashboard. This site has not read that choice yet, so it is still publishing: %s. Check the Site ID and token above.'=>'在 Zinn Digital® 方案中，您可以在仪表盘中该站点的“翻译”选项卡上选择要发布的语言。该站点尚未读取该选择，因此仍在发布：%s。请检查上方的站点 ID 和令牌。','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'在此处编辑任何翻译。编辑后的翻译将完全按照您编写的内容保留，并在重新翻译页面时绝不会被覆盖。','Every language'=>'所有语言','Search translations'=>'搜索翻译','Filter'=>'筛选','Content'=>'内容','Language'=>'语言','Translation'=>'翻译','Status'=>'状态','Save'=>'保存','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'尚未翻译任何内容。发布某种语言，后台将开始进行翻译。','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'这些地址已生效。请打开其中任意一个进行检查，并将站点地图索引提交至 Google Search Console。','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'您没有权限在此站点上编辑翻译。','Edited by you — kept'=>'由您编辑 — 已保留','Source changed — will be redone'=>'来源已更改 — 将重新执行','Up to date'=>'已是最新版本','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有事项需要注意','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'我们无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'该插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新的标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送此内容至 Zinn® 支持团队','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'这正是将要发送的全部内容——没有其他内容，也没有任何隐藏信息。其中不包含您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'将要发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持团队','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们将为您创建支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不希望发送，请复制上方内容并自行粘贴到工单中。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'我们无法从此服务器（%s）连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 — 您的设置没有任何问题。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已发送。Zinn® 支持团队已收到您的报告 — 参考编号 %s — 并将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多份报告。请等待几分钟后再试 — 之前的报告已成功送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接收报告——这是我们这边的问题，而非您的问题。请稍后重试，或将上述报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告已被拒绝 (HTTP %d)。请复制上方内容并开立工单，同时附上该编号。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'适用于 WordPress 的 Zinn® 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及专为管理多个网站的用户打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟的网站、域名和链接位置，资金将得到安全保管，直至双方均感到满意。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的专业人士','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业交易市场：浏览来自作者、设计师、开发者及 SEO 专家的 10,000 多个现成服务，或发布项目并让他们竞标。','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'API 密钥已被拒绝。请检查该密钥是否仍然有效且拥有翻译权限，然后重新保存。','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'服务商因账单或配额问题拒绝了请求。未翻译任何内容。请检查您在服务商处的账户余额和限制。','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'翻译服务提供商处出现问题。未进行任何翻译或扣费，将在下一次轮询时重试。','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'翻译请求失败，我们无法确定原因。未保存任何内容。','Sitemap index'=>'站点地图索引','%s sitemap'=>'%s 站点地图','LLM content map'=>'LLM 内容映射','%s LLM content map'=>'%s LLM 内容映射','Languages published'=>'已发布的语言','Site language'=>'站点语言','SEO plugin'=>'SEO 插件','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'尚未设置翻译服务提供商。','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'粘贴来自您所选提供商的 API 密钥，或将站点连接到 Zinn Digital® 账户，翻译将在下一次遍历时开始。','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'正在使用您自己的 %s 密钥进行翻译。','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'此站点未连接到 Zinn Digital® 账户，这没有问题 — 您的提供商会直接向您计费。','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'尚未连接到 Zinn Digital®。','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'从您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表盘添加此站点的 ID 和令牌，或切换为您自己的提供商密钥以在没有账户的情况下运行。','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'已连接到 Zinn Digital®。','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'翻译提供商遇到问题。','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'翻译已暂停 — 您的服务提供商需要关注。','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'翻译尚未设置。','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'我们这边出了点问题。','Check their status page'=>'查看其状态页面','Fix this on your account'=>'请在您的账户中修复此问题','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。下方的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'保持此项处于关闭状态，预设将按原样精确使用。','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Zinn® 语言切换器','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'允许访客以其他语言阅读此页面。','Title'=>'标题','Use the plugin setting'=>'使用插件设置','Dropdown'=>'下拉菜单','Inline list'=>'行内列表','Pills'=>'胶囊标签','Minimal text'=>'极简文本','Flags and names'=>'旗帜和名称','Stacked list'=>'堆叠列表','Choose a language'=>'选择语言','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Zinn® 更新服务未提供此更新的下载链接。请检查此站点是否可以访问 Zinn® 平台，然后重试。','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'无法从 Zinn® 更新服务（%s）下载更新。请在几分钟后重试。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未通过完整性检查，未予安装。','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'未保存任何 DeepL API 密钥，因此无法进行翻译。','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL 不支持翻译为%s。请为此语言选择 Google Gemini 或 OpenAI，或将网站连接到 Zinn Digital®。','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法访问 DeepL。未翻译任何内容，亦未收取任何费用；将在下一次处理时重试。','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'您本期的 DeepL 字符配额已用尽。重置后或在您的 DeepL 账户中提高限额后，翻译将会恢复。','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL 返回了无法读取的内容。未保存任何内容。','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'未保存任何 Google Gemini API 密钥，因此无法进行翻译。','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法访问 Google Gemini。未翻译任何内容，亦未收取任何费用；将在下一次运行时重试。','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'未保存任何 OpenAI API 密钥，因此无法进行翻译。','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法连接至 OpenAI。未翻译任何内容且未收取任何费用；将在下一次处理时重试。','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'此站点未连接到 Zinn Digital®，因此没有可收集的内容。请添加站点 ID 和令牌，或切换为您自己的提供商密钥。','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'此站点未连接到 Zinn Digital®。','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'无法连接到 Zinn Digital®。未发送任何内容；将在下一次运行时重试。','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'此站点上的翻译已暂停。请在您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表盘上检查账户是否为最新状态。','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. It must be an API key with the sites.view and sites.translation.manage permissions — create one on the API keys page of your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® 已拒绝此站点的令牌。它必须是具有 sites.view 和 sites.translation.manage 权限的 API 密